---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Underground Construction" description="Duct banks, sweeps, stub-ups, vaults and equipment pads built by our own excavation and electrical crews." path="/underground/">
<section id="underground"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <p class="label">Underground</p>
    <h1>Underground is our specialty.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Duct banks, sweeps and stub-ups built by our own excavation and electrical crews, on our own equipment. Laid out to the drawings, racked on strut, inspected and encased so the wire pulls go clean the first time.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cgrid">
    <figure class="lead"><img src="/u-ug2.jpg" alt="Long open trench with a full duct bank of PVC conduit and rows of stub-ups racked on strut" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Full duct bank run, stub-ups racked</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="tall"><img src="/u-trench.jpg" alt="Deep trench shored with a trench box beside a backhoe" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Shored trench, trench box in</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="third"><img src="/u-sweeps.jpg" alt="Banks of PVC conduit sweeping up out of the trench into stub-ups racked on strut" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Duct bank sweeps to stub-ups</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="third"><img src="/u-ug.jpg" alt="Formed equipment pads with conduit stub-ups racked on strut, ready for the concrete pour" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Stub-ups formed for the pour</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="third"><img src="/u-rack.jpg" alt="Conduit stub-ups racked on strut frames in open trenches while an excavator backfills" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Racked stub-ups ready for backfill</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
  <ul class="ugfacts" aria-label="Underground scope">
    <li>Trenching and excavation</li><li>Duct banks and conduit encasement</li><li>Sweeps and stub-ups racked on strut</li><li>Vaults and pull boxes</li><li>Switchgear, transformer and PME pads</li><li>Backfill, compaction and restoration</li>
  </ul>
</div></section>

<div class="ctaband"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Have a plan set? We'll price it.</h2>
  <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request a bid</a>
</div></div>
</Base>
